# Mobile app configuration. Copy to `.env`.
#
# The EXPO_PUBLIC_ prefix is required, not cosmetic: Expo inlines only prefixed
# variables into the bundle at build time (SDK 49+). A plain `API_BASE_URL` is
# invisible to the app at runtime, which is why this file's earlier form could
# never have taken effect.
#
# It also means these values ship inside the app and are readable by anyone who
# has it, so only non-secret configuration belongs here. NutriLens keeps every
# secret server-side (07: "No nutrition math, no secrets") — the USDA key lives
# only in the backend's own .env.

# Where the backend is reachable from the device running the app.
# Include the /api/v1 prefix: every path in src/api/ is relative to it (03 §Base URL).
#   Android emulator : http://10.0.2.2:8000/api/v1   (the emulator's alias for the host)
#   iOS simulator    : http://localhost:8000/api/v1
#   Physical device  : http://<your machine's LAN IP>:8000/api/v1
EXPO_PUBLIC_API_BASE_URL=http://10.0.2.2:8000/api/v1
